                "actuator",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "notification-service console should show (within a few seconds of the outbox tick):\nNOTIFICATION [SMS -> 0807<runId>]: Please contact the ward immediately regarding your family member.\nThe message carries no clinical detail (PRD 7.5). DB check (idempotency key = the outbox key):\ndocker exec -it careround-postgres psql -U postgres -d careround_notification_db -c \"SELECT idempotency_key, channel, recipient, status FROM sent_notifications WHERE idempotency_key LIKE 'emergency-declared-%' ORDER BY sent_at DESC LIMIT 3;\"\nKafka redelivery/replay of the same event is skipped ('already sent'); it never sends a second SMS."
